  "notes": "This show featured the Phish debut of What's Going Through Your Mind. What's Going Through Your Mind through Evolve, Blaze On, and Frankenstein featured Billy Strings on guitar with Billy adding vocals for What's Going Through Your Mind. Death Don't Hurt Very Long was performed in a slow, bluesy style. Mountains in the Mist featured Billy on acoustic guitar. Mike teased Eye of the Tiger as Fish was walking out on stage for the encore. Ginseng Sullivan (performed for the first time since June 21, 2019, or 189 shows) and The Old Home Place featured Billy on acoustic guitar and vocals. Frankenstein also featured Page on keytar.",
